# Studio (`apps/studio`)

Sanity Studio shell — config, plugins, and presentation tooling. Schemas live in `@repo/cms`.

## Config location

- `sanity.config.ts` — main Studio config
- `sanity.cli.ts` — CLI/deploy config
- `src/lib/presentation.ts` — location resolvers for visual editing
- `src/lib/resolve-href.ts` — preview URL mapping

## Plugins

- `structureTool` — default document structure
- `visionTool` — GROQ playground
- `presentationTool` — live preview against `localhost:3000`

When adding new document types, update presentation location resolvers so visual editing routes resolve correctly.

## Draft mode

Website draft routes live in `apps/website/src/app/api/draft-mode/`. Studio presentation depends on these — keep preview URLs in sync.

## Path aliases

| Alias | Path |
|-------|------|
| `@/*` | `./src/*` |
| `@/lib/*` | `./src/lib/*` |

## Imports from CMS

```ts
import { schemaTypes } from '@repo/cms/schemas'
```

Do not duplicate schema definitions in the studio app.
